WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Read one whole paragraph. Retell it, then move to the next paragraph.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
Choose one passage or a full four-passage section.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Start exercise and allow your microphone. Recording starts before the text appears.

00:16.000 --> 00:25.000
Read every sentence of paragraph 1. Choose Retell paragraph to hide it.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.000
Retell the whole paragraph aloud with the text hidden. Choose Next paragraph when finished.

00:32.000 --> 00:39.000
Read the next complete paragraph. Repeat the same read-and-retell routine.

00:39.000 --> 00:44.000
Retell paragraph 2. Continue through all paragraphs. Finish passage, or Next passage and Finish section.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
Finish and save the complete practice. Your completed passage and practice time are kept.

00:49.000 --> 01:00.000
Feedback starts after the finished practice is saved. Only hidden retelling speech is graded. This is illustrative feedback, not a real attempt.
